{"type":"message","id":"2dedd3d8","parentId":"e1b88274","timestamp":"2026-04-25T10:17:07.564Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 最简单的是重启 OpenClaw 的 gateway 服务。\n\n你这台机器上现在是 LaunchAgent 在跑，所以直接执行：\n\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n如果你想先看状态，再重启，可以用：\n\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway status\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n重启后你再给我发一句话，我就会按新的 workspace 配置回应。\n\n顺手说一句，我刚看了状态，服务现在是正常运行的，所以重启命令应该就够了。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_07756ba50f298d1d0169ec94a14aec81918bb0924308cddeae\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1494,"output":122,"cacheRead":20864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22480,"cost":{"input":0.0037350000000000005,"output":0.00183,"cacheRead":0.005216,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010781}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777112221467,"responseId":"resp_07756ba50f298d1d0169ec949f55988191a87daf7276066e90"}}
