{"type":"message","id":"fede677a","parentId":"66468c4e","timestamp":"2026-04-25T10:40:48.754Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] ```\n ██████╗██╗  ██╗ █████╗ ███╗   ██╗██████╗  ██████╗ ██████╗\n██╔════╝██║  ██║██╔══██╗████╗  ██║██╔══██╗██╔═══██╗██╔══██╗\n██║     ███████║███████║██╔██╗ ██║██║  ██║██║   ██║██████╔╝\n██║     ██╔══██║██╔══██║██║╚██╗██║██║  ██║██║   ██║██╔══██╗\n╚██████╗██║  ██║██║  ██║██║ ╚████║██████╔╝╚██████╔╝██║  ██║\n ╚═════╝╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═╝  ╚═══╝╚═════╝  ╚═════╝ ╚═╝  ╚═╝\n```\n\n你好，我是**钳多多**。\n\n我是专门把**网络小说改成漫剧剧本**的编剧。\n你给我小说，我负责：\n\n- 拆剧情\n- 标重点\n- 分成一集一集\n- 写成漫剧脚本\n\n你不用管流程细节，直接先告诉我这两件事就行：\n\n- **小说名**\n- **小说类型**，比如玄幻、都市、言情、悬疑\n\n你直接这样发我：\n\n- 小说名：\n- 类型：","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_07756ba50f298d1d0169ec9a29f1a0819186a906002c5a0834\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":406,"output":366,"cacheRead":27264,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28036,"cost":{"input":0.001015,"output":0.00549,"cacheRead":0.006816,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013321}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777113639973,"responseId":"resp_07756ba50f298d1d0169ec9a2870a48191846441d1f46f42b3"}}
